# Quantumult X AdBlock List Template
# 常见广告域名拦截模板
#
# 规则格式：HOST-SUFFIX,域名,REJECT
# HOST-SUFFIX 会匹配该域名及其所有子域名。
#
# Quantumult X 引用示例：
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lonecoding/QuantumultX-Rules/main/rules/adblock/adblock.list, tag=广告域名拦截, update-interval=86400, enabled=true
#
# 提示：广告域名可能随时间变化；若某个应用或网页异常，请先临时停用本列表，
# 再为误拦截域名添加 DIRECT 规则。本文件不包含订阅地址、服务器信息或访问令牌。
# Last updated: 2026-09-02

# --- Google 广告 ---
HOST-SUFFIX,doubleclick.net,REJECT
HOST-SUFFIX,googlesyndication.com,REJECT
HOST-SUFFIX,googleadservices.com,REJECT
HOST-SUFFIX,googletagservices.com,REJECT
HOST-SUFFIX,2mdn.net,REJECT

